.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Project Specific
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------

# Ignore large raw data files, but keep the directory structure
data/raw/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep

# Note: We are explicitly tracking `data/processed/*.csv` and `notebooks/weekly.csv` 
# because they are small enough (< 1MB) and necessary to run the demo.
# If larger datasets are added later, ignore them here:
# *.csv
# !data/processed/ml_forecasts.csv
# !data/processed/inventory_report.csv
# !notebooks/weekly.csv

# Ignore large model artifacts if they exceed GitHub's limits (>50MB)
# Currently rf_model is ~11MB, xgb_model is ~1MB, so we track them for the demo.
# If models grow larger, uncomment the following:
# src/models/*.joblib
# src/models/*.h5
# src/models/*.pkl
